#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize the service in an untrusted environment {#initialize-the-service-in-an-untrusted-environment}"
msgstr "I-initialize ang serbisyo sa isang hindi pinagkakatiwalaang kapaligiran {#initialize-the-service-in-an-untrusted-environment}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these instructions if you are working with IBM Cloud or the IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API in an untrusted environment, such as a public computer.\n"
msgstr "Sundin ang mga tagubiling ito kung nagtatrabaho ka sa IBM Cloud o sa IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API sa isang hindi pinagkakatiwalaang kapaligiran, tulad ng pampublikong kompyuter.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Avoid executing code on an untrusted machine or an external cloud Python environment to minimize security risks.** If you must use an untrusted environment (on, for example, a shared or public computer), change your API key after each use by deleting it on the [API keys page](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) and creating a new one.\n"
msgstr "**Iwasang mag-execute ng code sa isang hindi pinagkakatiwalaang makina o external na cloud Python environment para mabawasan ang mga panganib sa seguridad.** Kung kailangan mong gumamit ng hindi pinagkakatiwalaang kapaligiran (halimbawa, sa isang shared o pampublikong kompyuter), palitan ang iyong API key pagkatapos ng bawat paggamit sa pamamagitan ng pag-delete nito sa [pahina ng mga API key](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) at paglikha ng bago.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"      **Protect your API key!** Never include your key in source code, Python script, or notebook file. When sharing code with others, ensure that your API key is not embedded directly within the Python script. Instead, share the script without the token and provide instructions for securely setting it up.\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"      **Pangalagaan ang iyong API key!** Huwag isama ang iyong key sa source code, Python script, o notebook file. Kapag nagbabahagi ng code sa iba, tiyaking hindi direktang naka-embed ang iyong API key sa loob ng Python script. Sa halip, ibahagi ang script nang wala ang token at magbigay ng mga tagubilin para sa ligtas na pag-setup nito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      If you accidentally share your key with someone or include it in version control like Git, immediately revoke your key by following the [Deleting an API key](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui#delete_user_key) instructions on IBM Cloud.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"      Kung aksidenteng naibahagi mo ang iyong key sa iba o naisama ito sa version control tulad ng Git, agad na i-revoke ang iyong key sa pamamagitan ng pagsunod sa mga tagubilin ng [Deleting an API key](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui#delete_user_key) sa IBM Cloud.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"access-credentials\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"access-credentials\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your access credentials {#find-your-access-credentials}"
msgstr "Hanapin ang iyong mga access credential {#find-your-access-credentials}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your API key (also referred to as an  _API token_). From the [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), create your API key, then copy it to a secure location so you can use it for authentication. The token will not be visible again. Note that you can use a single API key to connect to any region.\n"
msgstr "Hanapin ang iyong API key (tinatawag din na _API token_). Mula sa [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), gumawa ng iyong API key, pagkatapos ay kopyahin ito sa isang ligtas na lugar para magamit mo ito sa authentication. Hindi na makikita muli ang token. Tandaan na maaari kang gumamit ng isang API key para kumonekta sa anumang rehiyon.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optional: Find the instance you want to use from the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. Hover over its CRN, click the icon to copy it, then save it in a secure location so you can use it to identify the instance.\n"
msgstr "Opsyonal: Hanapin ang instance na gusto mong gamitin mula sa pahina ng [Mga Instance](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). I-hover ang cursor sa ibabaw ng CRN nito, i-click ang icon para kopyahin ito, pagkatapos ay i-save ito sa isang ligtas na lugar para magamit mo ito sa pagkilala ng instance.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate to IBM Cloud in an untrusted environment {#authenticate-to-ibm-cloud-in-an-untrusted-environment}"
msgstr "Mag-authenticate sa IBM Cloud sa isang hindi pinagkakatiwalaang kapaligiran {#authenticate-to-ibm-cloud-in-an-untrusted-environment}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To initialize the service in this situation, use code like the following:\n"
msgstr "Para i-initialize ang serbisyo sa sitwasyong ito, gamitin ang code tulad ng sumusunod:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    # The credentials you enter will override any saved\n"
"    # account credentials that might be available locally.\n"
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(\n"
"      # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved from\n"
"      # the IBM Quantum Platform dashboard, and then delete\n"
"      # the key on the API keys page after entering this code:\n"
"      token=\"<your-API-key>\", \n"
msgstr ""
"    # The credentials you enter will override any saved\n"
"    # account credentials that might be available locally.\n"
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(\n"
"      # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved from\n"
"      # the IBM Quantum Platform dashboard, and then delete\n"
"      # the key on the API keys page after entering this code:\n"
"      token=\"<your-API-key>\",\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      # Optionally specify an instance to use\n"
"      instance=\"<IBM Cloud CRN or instance name>\"\n"
"      )\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"      # Optionally specify an instance to use\n"
"      instance=\"<IBM Cloud CRN or instance name>\"\n"
"      )\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"rest-untrusted\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"rest-untrusted\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate to the REST API in an untrusted environment {#authenticate-to-the-rest-api-in-an-untrusted-environment}"
msgstr "Mag-authenticate sa REST API sa isang hindi pinagkakatiwalaang kapaligiran {#authenticate-to-the-rest-api-in-an-untrusted-environment}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to use your API key directly to authenticate to the IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API, where `<your_API_KEY>` is the 44-character API key you created and saved from your IBM Quantum Platform dashboard.\n"
msgstr "Sundin ang mga hakbang na ito para gamitin nang direkta ang iyong API key sa pag-authenticate sa IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API, kung saan ang `<your_API_KEY>` ay ang 44-character na API key na ginawa at na-save mo mula sa iyong IBM Quantum Platform dashboard.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use your API key to generate a [bearer token](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest#authentication). A _bearer token_ is a temporary credential that expires after no more than one hour. After the acquired token expires, you must generate a new one to continue calling IBM Cloud or other service APIs. :\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang iyong API key para makagawa ng [bearer token](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest#authentication). Ang _bearer token_ ay isang pansamantalang credential na mag-e-expire pagkatapos ng hindi hihigit sa isang oras. Kapag nag-expire na ang nakuhang token, kailangan kang gumawa ng bago para mapatuloy ang pagtawag sa IBM Cloud o iba pang service API. :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "    ```bash\n"
#| "    curl -X POST 'https://iam.cloud.ibm.com/identity/token' \\\n"
#| "    -H 'Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded' \\\n"
#| "    -d 'grant_type=urn:ibm:params:oauth:grant-type:apikey&apikey=your_API_KEY'\n"
#| "    ```\n"
#| "    Copy and save the returned bearer token:  `\"access_token\": \"<NEW_BEARER_TOKEN>\"`\n"
#| "  1. Authenticate requests to the Qiskit Runtime REST API by including the CRN and bearer token in the request's headers.\n"
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    curl -X POST 'https://iam.cloud.ibm.com/identity/token' \\\n"
"    -H 'Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded' \\\n"
"    -d 'grant_type=urn:ibm:params:oauth:grant-type:apikey&apikey=your_API_KEY'\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Copy and save the returned bearer token:  `\"access_token\": \"<NEW_BEARER_TOKEN>\"`\n"
"  1. Authenticate requests to the IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API by including the CRN and bearer token in the request's headers.\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    curl -X POST 'https://iam.cloud.ibm.com/identity/token' \\\n"
"    -H 'Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded' \\\n"
"    -d 'grant_type=urn:ibm:params:oauth:grant-type:apikey&apikey=your_API_KEY'\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Kopyahin at i-save ang ibinalik na bearer token: `\"access_token\": \"<NEW_BEARER_TOKEN>\"`\n"
"  1. Mag-authenticate ng mga kahilingan sa Qiskit Runtime REST API sa pamamagitan ng pagsasama ng CRN at bearer token sa mga header ng kahilingan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```bash\n"
"      curl -X 'GET' \\\n"
"        'https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/v1/usage' \\\n"
"        '-H accept: application/json' \\\n"
"        '-H authorization: Bearer <BEARER_TOKEN>' \\\n"
"        '-H Service-CRN: <INSTANCE_CRN>'\n"
"      ```\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```bash\n"
"      curl -X 'GET' \\\n"
"        'https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/v1/usage' \\\n"
"        '-H accept: application/json' \\\n"
"        '-H authorization: Bearer <BEARER_TOKEN>' \\\n"
"        '-H Service-CRN: <INSTANCE_CRN>'\n"
"      ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change your API key after each use by [Deleting your existing API key](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui#delete_user_key) and generating a new API key on the [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) home page.\n"
msgstr "Palitan ang iyong API key pagkatapos ng bawat paggamit sa pamamagitan ng [Pag-delete ng iyong kasalukuyang API key](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui#delete_user_key) at paglikha ng bagong API key sa home page ng [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/).\n"

